  paragraphs:
  - 'AURORA: So, Cos, you never did tell me the story of how you and Skippy became
    friends. '
  - "COSMO: Hmm, I suppose we\u2019ve got some time to talk about that now. It all
    goes back to one of my earliest expeditions, Planet Orion."
  - "AURORA: Oh yes Orion, they\u2019re known for their beaches."
  - "COSMO: Would\u2019ve been lovely to see that, but I never ended up making it
    to Orion that day. I suffered my first nasty crash during a meteor storm and
    was hauled back to base. "
  - "COSMO: That\u2019s when me and Skippy first started to get to know each other,
    he was assigned to fix up my ship. "
  - "AURORA: Meteor storm? I can\u2019t imagine you getting caught in one of those."
  - 'COSMO: One can only dream Aurora. Rookie mistake trying to fly through that
    storm solo. Anyways, Skippy was the only person on The Space Corp that saw me
    as an equal. '
  - "COSMO: Didn\u2019t treat me differently just because I am Cassandra\u2019s son,
    thought I could get to know the guy well."
  - 'AURORA: Must have taken a long time to fix up your ship, huh?  '
  - 'COSMO: They could have just given me a fresh ready to go ship, but I came up
    with an excuse to keep that previous ship just so we could keep chatting together
    whilst he repaired it.'
  - "AURORA: That\u2019s adorable, thanks for telling me that, Cos. "
